Z||000011||Monkeyman||01-04-2000||05:17 AM||||Anyone who wants these just email me with your requests.  I'm working on getting these on another (well known) forum members website so that everyone can enjoy the fruits of my labor! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I really would like to sell some of these.  I don't care if I make much monkey  (er...I mean money <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">), but I think they look cool enough to be put on some other cars and I can't afford to give them away.  <P>Cliff--I'm working on a way to get the "Pontiac" on there like the GT but it would need some mods to the car.  I should know something in a couple of weeks.  I just went back to work yesterday, so now I have 9 hours a day less to think about it.||||reg||1
