Z||000013||Monkeyman||01-06-2000||06:15 PM||||"Pontiac Fiero" could be done but you'd probably need/want to convert the inner marker light to a brake/marker/ts light.  Easy enough to do.  Email me and I'll explain.  <P>Hopefully by sometime next week I'll have my mod on a famous persons website.  (No names until it's done.  And I want to publicly thank this famous person for the opportunity.)  Here's the deal.  I will sell the 1st 20 of these to Forum members only for $15 plus shipping.  After that I'll raise the price slightly.  If you want one (or 2 or 10!!!), email me.  I'm not making much money at this price, but I don't mind because you fellow forum members have been so good to me.  I am working on getting "Pontiac" in the middle of the notchback tail lights, but it might be a few weeks while the prototype is made  (Damn, I love working in a metal fab shop!).  Be patient.  If I can sell that mod for a reasonable cost, I'll post it too.||||reg||1
